                    "\"Journal Entry 004: Regional Variants of Magikarp and Gyarados\"",
                    "\"One day, I was out fishing and came across a magikarp with a peculiar pattern that I had never seen before. Upon further inspection, I discovered that this was a local variant with colors to fit in the surrounding biome.\"",
                    "\"These pokemon seemed to be rather elusive. Never surfacing, and only obtainable through fishing with a pokerod.\"",
                    "\"The more I fished, the more vibrant the colors became. Each catch with a unique pattern and color pallet matching the area it was from.\"",
